<https://w3id.org/miUrba#Contrato> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Contract"@en .
<https://w3id.org/miUrba#Contrato> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Contrato"@es .
